  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "IPRoyal sells residential, ISP, datacenter, and mobile proxies with a published residential floor from $1.75/GB. Traffic is marketed as never expiring. startingPriceMonthly $1.75 is that per-GB floor (a 1GB pack equivalent), not a monthly SaaS seat. Same web-data-collection cluster as Bright Data. Bright Data remains the award (7.7); this entity does not outrank it. Budget / SMB proxy peer of ThorData and Decodo (Smartproxy) — thinner enterprise compliance and platform depth than Bright Data / Oxylabs.",
